<title>SWEDEN: H&amp;M shares up on 30 pct Q1 sales rise.</title>
<headline>H&amp;M shares up on 30 pct Q1 sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Swedish fashion retailer Hennes &amp; Mauritz rose on the Stockholm bourse on Thursday afternoon after the company said sales rose 30 percent in the first quarter of 1997 against Q1 1996.</p>
<p>At 1240 GMT H&amp;M shares were trading 44 crowns higher at 1,044 crowns.</p>
<p>&quot;It is a very good sales improvement,&quot; one broker said.</p>
<p>H&amp;M also said in a statement to coincide with its annual general meeting that the trend in sales and earnings remained positive.</p>
<p>-- Belinda Goldsmith, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1045</p>
